          "fails": true
        },
        {
          "source": "/invoicing",
          "id": "01923e8a-0000-7000-8000-000000000004"
        },
        {
          "source": "/invoicing",
          "id": "01923e8a-0000-7000-8000-000000000004"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "effects": 1
      },
      "why": "AM5. Replay redelivers the same envelope, id and all; AM3 makes it safe, and the final duplicate (an operator replaying twice) is absorbed the same way."
    },
    {
      "case": "a-provider-event-re-enveloped-twice-has-one-effect",
