        },
        {
          "source": "/stripe",
          "id": "evt_1PqR9s2eZvKYlo2C"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "effects": 1
      },
      "why": "AM8. An inbound webhook becomes an envelope with the provider as source and the provider's event id as id, so a provider redelivery is a repeat under AM3 with no provider-specific logic."
